DEFINE FIELD f ON t MIGRATE EXISTING ROWS AS m;
DEFINE FIELD f ON t MIGRATE ROWS AS m USING 1;
DEFINE FIELD f ON t MIGRATE EXISTING ROWS m USING 1;
-- A table's migration removes undeclared fields; a field's transforms them.
ALTER TABLE t MIGRATE EXISTING ROWS AS m USING 1;
ALTER TABLE t MIGRATE EXISTING ROWS AS m REMOVE FIELDS;
ALTER FIELD f ON t MIGRATE EXISTING ROWS AS m REMOVE UNDECLARED FIELDS;
DEFINE TABLE t MIGRATE EXISTING ROWS AS m REMOVE UNDECLARED FIELDS;
